      "text": "Keep it going for Parth. There's Alvandhi, a musical duet performance showcasing a unique blend of traditional analog, mechanical instruments, and modern digital MIDI instruments. This ensemble features analog sounds from the flute, harp, rainstick, and alongside their digital counterparts, including the flute, tampura, and tabla. Collaboration between classical and contemporary musical technologies. One more time for Parth, everybody."
